        "id": 1000009
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-08-24T08:00:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This still sounds like you\u0027re suggesting we define properties in the config of the current board for a device present on a downstream board. If that\u0027s not what you\u0027re trying to describe, can you please reword this.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 18,
